            <p>Configuration values can be retrieved using typed getters:</p>
            <pre class="code-block"><code>auto neuronCount = config.getOr<int64_t>("neuron_count", 1000);
auto timestep = config.getOr<double>("simulation_timestep", 0.001);
auto logLevel = config.getOr<std::string>("log_level", "INFO");</code></pre>
            
